{'symbol': 'WBA', 'date': '2021-02-24 13:00:00', 'title': 'WALGREENS TO MAKE PIXEL BY LABCORP™ COVID-19 PCR TEST HOME COLLECTION KIT AVAILABLE OVER-THE-COUNTER AT STORES NATIONWIDE', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL. & BURLINGTON, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AS PART OF WALGREENS ONGOING EFFORTS TO INCREASE ACCESS TO COVID-19 TESTING IN COMMUNITIES ACROSS THE U.S., THE COMPANY ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT WITH LABCORP™ TO SELL PIXEL BY LABCORP COVID-19 PCR TEST HOME COLLECTION KITS OVER-THE-COUNTER IN UP TO 6,000 WALGREENS STORES NATIONWIDE BEGINNING IN SPRING OF THIS YEAR. WALGREENS IS MAKING SIGNIFICANT STRIDES TO INCREASE ON-SITE TESTING CAPACITY AT MORE THAN 5,000 WALGREENS'}